{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/assistant/default-model.ts",
    "title": "测试用确定性助手模型",
    "summary": "该模块提供无需 LLM 的确定性 AssistantModelPort 实现，只用于测试检索结果展示和引用传播，不属于生产降级路径。",
    "category": "tests",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "purpose",
        "title": "测试替身的职责",
        "body": "`DeterministicAssistantModel` 是测试替身，不进行推理，只把运行时已经检索出的证据组合成固定格式回答。文件注释明确规定生产装配必须使用真实 `AcpAssistantModel`；没有可用模型时应显式降级，不能用该类制造看似真实的回答。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "behavior_limits",
        "title": "可断言行为与未覆盖范围",
        "body": "实现最多选取前五条证据，每条正文截取 160 字符，并把对应 fragmentId 原样作为引用；有历史轮次时只追加“延续上一话题”的轮次提示。无证据时返回固定的“没有直接相关内容”回答且引用为空。[[c2]]\n\n因此它适合断言证据数量上限、标题/文本投影、引用集合及有无历史的输出差异，但不覆盖语义相关性、ACP 传输、JSON 解析、取消超时、工具治理或模型故障恢复；这些能力也未在本材料中由测试文件直接证明。[[c2]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "确定性模型的测试限定",
        "reason": "支持该实现仅用于测试、生产不得把它作为假降级答案的说明。",
        "relation": "background",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/assistant/default-model.ts",
          "startLine": 7,
          "endLine": 15
        },
        "quote": "/**\n * Deterministic stand-in for the real LLM composer. It performs no inference:\n * it surfaces the evidence the runtime already retrieved and cites fragments.\n *\n * This exists ONLY for tests. Production assembly must inject the real\n * `AcpAssistantModel`; when no model is configured the runtime degrades honestly\n "
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "固定回答生成逻辑",
        "reason": "说明五条证据上限、截断、引用、历史提示和无证据分支，也界定其可直接断言的行为。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/assistant/default-model.ts",
          "startLine": 16,
          "endLine": 40
        },
        "quote": "  async generate(input: {\n    userText: string;\n    priorTurns: { ordinal: number; userText: string; result: string }[];\n    evidence: AssistantEvidence[];\n    visibility: \"private\" | \"group\";\n  }): Promise<AssistantModelReply> {\n    const evidence = input.evidence.slice(0, 5);\n    if (!evidence.length) {\n      return "
      }
    ],
